# Normalize text to LF in the repo; check out native on Windows.
# Without this, the CRLF the Windows runner writes shows up as a whole-file diff.
* text=auto

# Snapshot baselines are compared byte-for-byte — never let git touch them.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary

# Text baselines (llms.txt, llms-full.txt) are compared byte-for-byte too. The
# generator writes LF, so a CRLF checkout would fail every line.
portal-snapshots/**/*.txt -text
